WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:02.131
You learn in one place.

00:00:02.241 --> 00:00:03.475
Build in another.

00:00:03.585 --> 00:00:05.547
Track your progress nowhere.

00:00:05.657 --> 00:00:08.624
And every AI conversation starts from zero.

00:00:10.762 --> 00:00:12.112
Meet Placiq.

00:00:12.162 --> 00:00:14.810
Your AI-native Career Intelligence OS.

00:00:17.113 --> 00:00:20.027
One workspace, where everything you do connects.

00:00:20.913 --> 00:00:22.624
